	(text "J14: GND, +5V_SYS, HEAT_EN, CUT_EN. J17: AC_L_FUSED, AC_N, PE.\nCarrier channel 1: J15/J16. Carrier channel 2: J18/J19.\nInput flags represent carrier 5 V. No PE-to-GND bond."
